What is 'the entire idea of the game'? As far as I can tell, nethack
is a wild mashup of heaps of unrelated themes; from the usual fantasy
fare of elves, dragons, and dwarves, stretching out to some more
specialised fantasy themes with stuff like the riders and Vlad, and
then reaching way out into the modern and the bizarre with things like
quantum mechanics, tourists, archeologists; and so on.

Assault rifles and ray guns may seem a bit out of place, but really,
what doesn't seem out of place? (... all that aside, I think assault
rifles are too 'serious' to be included in a mostly-fantasy game like
